<p>lo momino qulaasa suno is bayaan ka<br />
bano ko pursa do che mahine ki jaan ka<br />
par haal kis zabaa'n se kahoo'n bezubaan ka<br />
kyu gir pada na phat ke tabaq aasmaan ka</p>

<p>jhule me di panaah na maa ke kanaar me<br />
kaati adoo ne gardan-e- asghar mazaar me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lipte huwe azizoun ke lasho'n se the haram<br />
jo aah sar shahidou ke hone lage qalam<br />
ginn ginn ke qud umar ne kiye naizo par alam<br />
bola mulazimou'n se abhi ek sar hai kam</p>

<p>is dam mujhe qayall-e- itaab-e yazeed hai<br />
arzi main likh chuka hoon bahattar shaheed hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>peetenge is bayan se sab koda-kho jawaa'n<br />
ye taaza waaqiya hai ghazab ki hai daastaa'n<br />
kyu qushk hogayi na sitamgaar ki zabaa'n<br />
bola umar talaash karo qabr ka nashaa'n</p>

<p>bachhe ki qabr khodh ke sar ko qalam karo<br />
akbar ke sar ke paas sinaa par alam karo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baaz laraz laraz ke pukare ke al- hazar<br />
ham to na qabr khodenge zaalim quda se dar<br />
is bezabaan shaheed ke sin par to raham kar<br />
sota hai saari raat ka jaaga lahu me tarr</p>

<p>dekhe na chain jhule ke na maa ki god ke<br />
bachche ke sar na kaatenge ham qabr khod ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kya uski qabr se tujhe daawaah hai aye laee'n<br />
hazrath ne mol li thi ye maqtal ki sab zamee'n<br />
be dafn hain mahe rufaqaa baad shaah-e- dee'n<br />
be ghar hain ahlebait-e- shahinshah-e- mursalee'n</p>

<p>murdou ko gor zindou ki qaatir makaa'n nahin<br />
ek baccha qabr me hai use bhi amaa'n nahin<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rote the haaye laash-e shahidou pa sab haram<br />
kya dekhte hain aata hai ek baaniye sitam<br />
noke sinaa'n chubota hai mitti me dam badam<br />
fizza pukaari qair kare rabbe zul karam</p>

<p>ye qabr dhoondta hai kisi naazneen ki<br />
naize se dekhta hai ye narmi zameen ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bano ne pucha deeda-e dil se bahake khoo'n<br />
jo yaa hai kiski qabr ka ye zalim-e-zaboo'n<br />
fizza pukari qaak mere mu me kya kahoo'n<br />
main kis zabaan se saahibe turbat ka naam loo'n</p>

<p>khodega maqbaraa che mahine ki jaan ka<br />
maangaa hai ibn-e-saad ne sar be zabaan ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>paikaan jis gale se abhi ho chuka hai paar<br />
hae hae usi gale pa phiregi churi ki dhaar<br />
araamgah murdoun ka hai gosha-e mazaar<br />
bibi ke laqte dil ko waha'n bhi nahi qaraar</p>

<p>ne faateha na phool kisi noor-e- ain ke<br />
hote hain zibha qabr me bachhe hussain ke<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>